usage: hia_native_language_coverage.py [-h] --hepta HEPTA --runtime-source
                                       RUNTIME_SOURCE --expected-hepta-source
                                       EXPECTED_HEPTA_SOURCE
                                       --expected-runtime-source
                                       EXPECTED_RUNTIME_SOURCE --cold-report
                                       COLD_REPORT --native-source-bootstrap
                                       NATIVE_SOURCE_BOOTSTRAP
                                       --bootstrap-distribution
                                       BOOTSTRAP_DISTRIBUTION
                                       --expected-bootstrap-distribution
                                       EXPECTED_BOOTSTRAP_DISTRIBUTION
                                       --native-bootstrap NATIVE_BOOTSTRAP
                                       --native-toolchain NATIVE_TOOLCHAIN
                                       --prebuild-execution PREBUILD_EXECUTION
                                       --cold-execution COLD_EXECUTION
                                       --post-execution POST_EXECUTION
                                       --output OUTPUT

Run the original language witnesses against admitted native-cold B3 and M3.
This external qualification observer preserves the selected Hepta fixture
generators, independent Core VM oracles and native result assertions. It never
builds a Python seed or replaces the selected native source contract.
Reference observations precede this language run; the separate native cold
report owns the original before-B0 reference requirement.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --hepta HEPTA
  --runtime-source RUNTIME_SOURCE
  --expected-hepta-source EXPECTED_HEPTA_SOURCE
  --expected-runtime-source EXPECTED_RUNTIME_SOURCE
  --cold-report COLD_REPORT
  --native-source-bootstrap NATIVE_SOURCE_BOOTSTRAP
  --bootstrap-distribution BOOTSTRAP_DISTRIBUTION
  --expected-bootstrap-distribution EXPECTED_BOOTSTRAP_DISTRIBUTION
  --native-bootstrap NATIVE_BOOTSTRAP
  --native-toolchain NATIVE_TOOLCHAIN
  --prebuild-execution PREBUILD_EXECUTION
  --cold-execution COLD_EXECUTION
  --post-execution POST_EXECUTION
  --output OUTPUT
